{"url": "https://bacollege.ac.in/page-details.php?name=Academic-Monitoring-Committee&pgurl=dc9e97d2728f2cb684918f600", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://bacollege.ac.in/page-details.php?name=Academic-Monitoring-Committee&pgurl=dc9e97d2728f2cb684918f600", "text": "Academic Monitoring Committee Bhawanipur Anchalik College : Bhawanipur, Barpeta\nAffiliated to Gauhati University\nReaccredited by NAAC with B Grade (Third Cycle)\nnew\nNational Conference on Viksit Bharat\nAdmission Portal\nCall us\n+91 9435024378\nLocation\nBhawanipur, Barpeta - 781352\nAbout Us\nAbout College\nMission & Vision\nFrom the Desk of the Principal i/c\nFrom the Chair of the President\nAwards\nProfile of the Principal I/C\nAdministration\nGoverning Body\nIncumbency list of the Presidents of Governing Body\nIncumbency list of the Principals\nOrganogram of the College\nCommittees/Cells\nInternal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC)\nWomen Cell\nGrievance Redressal Cell/Committee for Sexual Harassment\nPlanning Committee\nAcademic Monitoring Committee\nLibrary Advisory Committee\nExtension Education Cell\nCareer Counselling Cell\nResearch & Development Cell\nBharat Scouts & Guides Committee\nNSS Cell\nUSHA Sewing School Committee\nBeautician Training Centre Committee\nInstitutions' Innovation Council\nSakha Sahitya Sabha, Bhawanipur Anchalik College\nInternal Complaints Committee\nAnti Ragging Committee\nMinority Cell\nOBC Cell\nSC/ST Cell\nSC/ST Cell\nRed Ribbon Club\nElectoral Literacy Club\nScience Forum\nSAP (Swachhta Action Plan) Committees\nUnnat Bharat Abhiyan\nPM USHA\nKKHSOU\nSWAYAM Committee\nEqual Opportunity Cell\nPurchase Committee\nLaboratory Committee\nCultural Committee\nSports Committee\nGreen Audit Cell\nEnergy Audit Cell\nGreen Earth Club\nEco Club\nYuva Tourism Club\nCourses\nHS Programme, Arts and Science\nUndergraduate Programmes\nCourses under KKHSOU\nCourses Under GUCDOE\nAcademic Calendar\nState Open School\nSewing & Design (under USHA International)\nLibrary\nRules of Central Library\nLibrary Books\nCentral Library of the College\nLibrary Staff\nQuestion papers\nArts\nScience\nDepartments\nArts\nArabic\nAssamese\nEconomics\nEducation\nEnglish\nHistory\nPhilosophy\nPolitical Science\nCommerce\nCommerce\nScience\nBotany\nChemistry\nGeography\nMathematics\nPhysics\nZoology\nE-Learning\nE-Learning\nIQAC\nAbout IQAC\nNotices of IQAC\nSelf-Study Report\nAnnual Quality Assurance Report (AQAR)\nDocuments for DVV (AQAR)\nDocuments for DVV (SSR)\nIQAC Meeting Minutes\nStudents Satisfaction Survey Report\nInstitutional Information\nDifferent Committees and Cells\nResult Analysis of the Departments\nNIRF\nNIRF 2025\nNIRF 2026\nOffice Staff\nOffice Staff\nHostels\nForm 2022-23\nWomen Hostel Management Committee\nSports Hostel Management Committee (Boys')\nAzadi Ka Amrit Mahotsov\nHar Ghar Tiranga\nFeedback\nQuestionnaires\nFORMAT FOR TEACHER APPRAISAL REPORT\nSTUDENTS, TEACHERS ALUMNI FEEDBACK FEEDBACK FROMS\nRTI Declaration\nRTI Declaration\nPOs & COs\nCourse Outcome and Programme Outcome\nNAAC\nSSR 3rd Cycle\nCertificate\nSkill Training\nSkill Training Centre under Ministry of Commerce and Industry\nExamination Board\nExamination Board\nExamination Related Notices\nInstitutional Repository\nAcademic Monitoring Committee\nHome\nAcademic Monitoring Committee\nAcademic Monitoring Committee, Bhawanipur Anchalik College\nIn accordance with the directives outlined in the Department of Higher Education (DHE), Assam [Ecf: 443667/31 dated: Kalilipara, 4\nth\nApril, 2024], the Academic Committee of the Bhawanipur Anchalik College is reconstituted and renamed as the Academic Monitoring Committee (AMC).\nThe AMC of the college is a key entity responsible for overseeing and enhancing the quality of academic programs and student learning experiences. Comprising the principal, vice principal, HoDs, coordinator, and a few non-teaching members, this committee plays a crucial role in monitoring curriculum implementation, assessing teaching-learning methodologies, and ensuring academic standards in the college. The Academic Monitoring Committee conducts regular evaluations, gathers feedback from students and faculties, and recommends improvements to promote academic excellence and student success. Also, the committee conducts a meeting every 45 days and submits the report to the DHE, Assam. AMC, Bhawanipur Anchalik College, is optimistic about the implementation of OBE as per NEP in the upcoming session. The current members of the committee are listed below:\n1.\nPrincipal of the College (Chairperson)\n2.\nVice-Principal of the College (Vice-Chairperson)\n3.\nDr. Priyanka Pratim Baruah (Coordinator)\n4.\nAll HoDs (Members)\n5.\nMr. Himangshu Das (Non-Teaching Member)\nThe mission, vision, and objectives of the committee are given below.\nMission:\nThe mission of the Academic Monitoring Committee is to ensure the highest standards of academic excellence and integrity within the institution. The committee aims to:\n1. Oversee Academic Quality\n: Monitor and evaluate the quality of teaching, learning, and research activities.\n2. Promote Continuous Improvement\n: Foster a culture of continuous improvement in academic practices and policies.\n3. Ensure Compliance\n: Ensure adherence to educational standards and regulatory requirements.\n4. Support Student Success\n: Enhance student academic performance and success through effective monitoring and support mechanisms.\nVision:\nThe vision of the Academic Monitoring Committee is to create an academically robust and innovative environment that nurtures intellectual growth and excellence. The committee envisions\n1. Academic Excellence\n: Establishing the institution as a leader in academic excellence and innovation.\n2. Holistic Development\n: Promoting the holistic development of students by ensuring a well-rounded and high-quality educational experience.\n3. Global Competitiveness\n: Preparing students to be globally competitive through rigorous academic standards and cutting-edge educational practices.\n4. Sustainable Growth\n: Facilitating sustainable growth in academic programs and infrastructure to meet future educational demands.\nObjective(s):\n1.\nTo provide clear guidelines to all teaching staff regarding curriculum planning and implementation.\n2.\nTo develop a mechanism for academic monitoring to ensure effective implementation of academic planner.\n3.\nTo ensure that all departments have done proper planning before the commencement of semester for conduction of lectures and practical’s.\n4.\nTo ensure that effective teaching - learning is taking place throughout the semester.\n5.\nTo ensure that effective continuous assessment and evaluation is taking place to support teaching – learning.\n6.\nTo ensure that slow learners and advanced learners are taken care as per their needs.\n7.\nTo ensure that students are mentored for academic as well as personality development.\n8.\nTo ensure the attainment of course outcomes and eventually the program outcomes.\n9.\nTo monitoring the academic performance, training and placement of the students.\n10.\nPlanning and monitoring for Faculty development.\nMinutes of Meeting 1\nClick here\nMinutes of Meeting 2\nClick here\nAddress\nP.O-Bhawanipur, Dist-Barpeta, Assam, Pin-781352\n+91 9435024378(M)\ninfo@bacollege.ac.in\nbacbhawanipur@gmail.com\nwww.bacollege.ac.in\nUseful Links\nUGC\nNAAC\nRUSA\nINFLIBNET\nGauhati University\nDepartment Login\nConnect With Us\nOffice Hours\nMon - Saturday :\n10.00 am - 5.00 pm\nSunday :\nClosed\nCopyright ©2018 Bhawanipur Anchalik College. All Rights Reserved . Powered by\nDigitech Software\nFAQ\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nTerms & Condition", "links": [{"label": "new National Conference on Viksit Bharat", "url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vbbac2026/home"}, {"label": "Admission Portal", "url": "https://admission.bacollege.ac.in"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://bacollege.ac.in/index.php"}, {"label": "Call us", "url": "https://bacollege.ac.in